@startuml
title 6.7 Diagrama de Secuencia - Llamadas a Otros Microservicios

actor "Cliente API" as Cliente
participant "routes/provider.py" as Routes
participant "services/provider.py" as Service
participant "clients.py" as Clients
participant "ms-autenticacion" as AUTH
participant "ms-roles" as ROLES
participant "ms-auditoria" as AUDIT
participant "ms-notificaciones" as NOTIF

Cliente -> Routes: POST /api/v1/evaluaciones
activate Routes

note over Routes
Envio de request al microservicio
end note

Routes -> Routes: generar_request_id()
note over Routes
request_id = PRV-{timestamp}-{random_id}
Seguimiento end-to-end
end note

Routes -> Clients: validaciones y coordinacion
activate Clients

Clients -> AUTH: validar_sesion(token)
activate AUTH
AUTH --> Clients: usuario_id, role_id
deactivate AUTH

note over Clients
Primera llamada externa
end note

Clients -> ROLES: validar_permiso(role_id, permission_code)
activate ROLES
ROLES --> Clients: autorizado=true
deactivate ROLES

note over Clients
Segunda llamada externa
end note

Clients --> Routes: validaciones completadas
deactivate Clients

Routes -> Service: registrar_evaluacion(data)
activate Service

Service -> Service: logica de negocio

Service -> Clients: enviar alerta (async)
activate Clients

Clients -> NOTIF: enviar_puntaje_bajo(empresa, puntaje)
activate NOTIF

note over NOTIF
Tercera llamada externa
Operacion asincronica
end note

NOTIF --> Clients: ok
deactivate NOTIF

Clients --> Service: notificacion enviada
deactivate Clients

Service --> Routes: resultado de la operacion
deactivate Service

Routes -> Clients: registrar en auditoria
activate Clients

Clients -> AUDIT: registrar_auditoria(request_id, funcionalidad, ...)
activate AUDIT

note over AUDIT
Cuarta llamada externa
Registra toda operacion
end note

AUDIT --> Clients: ok
deactivate AUDIT

Clients --> Routes: auditoria registrada
deactivate Clients

Routes --> Cliente: StandardResponse{request_id, data, success}
deactivate Routes

note right of AUTH
Microservicio: ms-autenticacion
Validacion de tokens JWT
Endpoint: POST /api/v1/session/validate
end note

note right of ROLES
Microservicio: ms-roles
Control de acceso basado en roles
Endpoint: POST /api/v1/permisos/validar
end note

note right of AUDIT
Microservicio: ms-auditoria
Registro de todas las operaciones
Endpoint: POST /api/v1/auditorias
end note

note right of NOTIF
Microservicio: ms-notificaciones
Envio de alertas
Endpoint: POST /api/v1/notificaciones
end note

@enduml
